These are the property of the artists, photographers and designers who created
them. They were provided to Form:at for use on formatglasgow.com and for
promoting the events they relate to. That permission does not extend to anyone
else, and publishing this repository does not widen it.

You may not copy, redistribute, modify or reuse them, in any medium, including
as training data for machine-learning systems. They are present in this
repository only because the site is built from it.

If you want to use one of these images, contact the artist directly. If you are
an artist pictured here and want your image removed, open an issue or get in
touch and it will be taken down.

Audio recordings are not in this repository at all; they are served from
separate storage and are likewise all rights reserved.
